g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/08/oxyes85u29yufo925u802qdw5hqd5jd.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%86%9B%E9%AD%82%E9%92%A2%E9%93%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/08/oxyes85u29yufo925u802qdw5hqd5jd.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />军魂钢铸\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，物防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">必胜战吼</font></span>]触发时，额外对敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]的目标伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，产生<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命汲取\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命汲取</font></span></span>]；受到拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]目标攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，物防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">必胜战吼</font></span>]触发时，额外对敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]的目标伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>，产生<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命汲取\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命汲取</font></span></span>]，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">崩山击</font></span>]对其伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>；受到拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]目标攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，物防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">必胜战吼</font></span>]触发时，额外使已方获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲物防3</font></span></span>]，对敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]的目标伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，产生<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命汲取\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命汲取</font></span></span>]，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">崩山击</font></span>]对其伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>；受到拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"孤立\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">孤立</font></span></span>]目标攻击时，受到伤害